Uhhh, nah. NetHack is not Dungeons and Dragons, but NetHack _is_
respectful to its source mythologies, and D&D is the source mythology
of the Demon Princes (well, not really, but game-mechanics-wise yes) So
the only way I'll accept this is if we also do away with their names
and identities in favour of randomly generated ones. (Or, perhaps, none
at all.)

Doesn't Linley's Dungeon Crawl have randomised demons in Pandemonium?

